{"item_id": "feed:https://www.treelinereview.com/gearreviews/best-rain-gear-for-kids", "version_id": "ba81a92eb4678d651e4b9c03d597595be346c7d518cbd26ead178e00ad48c82f", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Under the Exclusions and Relevance sections, kids' rain gear for everyday school and playground use is not Mammoth competitor gear; the item is a single-author, affiliate-funded buying guide aimed at parents, with no Mammoth conditions, weight-carried-for-days testing, or Mammoth-specific evidence. Its rain gear content is an out-of-scope product line for the audience, so it does not help a competitor decide what to carry.", "piece_ids": []}
{"item_id": "feed:https://www.treelinereview.com/gearreviews/best-walking-shoes-men", "version_id": "269805f4b18e128a306ef239975a5de1cdff96e6551ee3fa8a07d48fc2b86e9a", "decision": "defer", "reason": "Under the Relevance section, footwear for walking is a plausible rucking/endurance category, but the guide is oriented to office, travel, and hospital shifts rather than multi-day loaded carry, and its evidence is a single publisher's testing with an affiliate model and no independent corroboration. Under the Credibility and Commercial Incentives sections, its 'we tested' claims are not tied to Mammoth conditions, and the HOKA Bondi SR top pick is asserted with no independent source; the item is relevant but too thin to rely on yet.", "piece_ids": []}
{"item_id": "feed:https://www.treelinereview.com/gearreviews/saucony-triumph-24-road-running-shoe-review", "version_id": "0a185c2f72e172f484769c08c69312fb5564f957179e64da21f142daf0631ade", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Under the Relevance section, this is a road running shoe review focused on daily training and recovery runs, which is outside the in-scope rucking and endurance categories for Mammoth carry conditions; the item also offers no weight-carried-for-days, load, or Mammoth-relevant testing. Under the Commercial Incentives and Credibility sections, the affiliate model and single-publisher testing (manufacturer specs plus the author's own 50 miles) add no independent corroboration relevant to Mammoth.", "piece_ids": []}
